{"privacy/index.html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Fingo \u2014 Privacy policy & community rules</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#12051f;color:#12051f;font:16px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter',Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}\n.wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}.card{background:#F6EFFF;border-radius:32px;padding:28px 24px}\nh1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:900}h2{font-size:22px;margin:26px 0 6px;font-weight:800}\na{color:#0d0d0f}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#fff;padding:8px 4px 16px;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none}\n.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#0d0d0f;color:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin:6px 6px 0 0}\n.green{background:#FF6B5F;color:#12051f}.foot{color:#a99bc6;font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:18px}li{margin:4px 0}</style></head><body><div class=\"wrap\"><a class=\"top\" href=\"/fingo/\"><img class=\"logo\" src=\"/fingo/fingo-mark.png\" alt=\"\">Fingo</a><div class=\"card\"><h1>Fingo \u2014 Privacy Policy</h1>\n<p><i>Last updated: November 2026</i></p>\n<p>Fingo (\"the app\", \"we\") is published by Destiny Global Solutions Limited. It is a party game you play with friends. This policy explains what we collect and why.</p>\n<p>Questions or requests: <b><a href=\"mailto:developer@destinyglobals.com\">developer@destinyglobals.com</a></b>.</p>\n<h2>What we collect</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Profile:</b> your display name and profile photo (taken with your camera or chosen from your gallery).</li>\n<li><b>Account ID:</b> an ID from Sign in with Apple or Google, or an anonymous guest ID. We do not receive your Apple/Google password. If you use Sign in with Apple you can hide your email.</li>\n<li><b>Game data:</b> your answers, votes, emoji reactions and anonymous cards you write during a party; the party PIN; game statistics (games played, times \"exposed\", crowns).</li>\n<li><b>Voice chat (only if you join it):</b> your voice is sent directly, live, to the other people in the voice room. We never record or store audio, and it does not pass through our database. Our database only stores who is in the voice room and short technical messages needed to connect the phones (deleted after use and within 6 hours at most).</li>\n<li><b>Safety data:</b> people you block, and reports you file (the reported content and the IDs involved).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We do <b>not</b> record voice chat, and we do <b>not</b> collect your contacts, location, advertising identifiers, or browsing data, and we do not track you across other apps.</p>\n<h2>How we use it</h2>\n<p>Only to run the game: showing your name and photo to the people in your party, counting votes, keeping your stats, and keeping the community safe (reviewing reports, removing abusive users). We do not sell your data and we do not show ads.</p>\n<h2>Who can see it</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Players in your party</b> see your name, photo, and the results of each round (for example the percentage of votes, and \u2014 unless the host chose anonymous voting \u2014 who voted for whom).</li>\n<li><b>Your individual answers</b> are only read by the party host's app, which counts the votes. Anonymous cards are never shown with your name.</li>\n<li><b>Our service provider:</b> data is stored with Google Firebase (Firebase Authentication and Cloud Firestore), which processes it on our behalf.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How long we keep it</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Party data (answers, cards, reactions) is kept for <b>up to 24 hours</b> after a party starts, then deleted or no longer used.</li>\n<li>Your profile and stats stay until you delete your account.</li>\n<li>Reports are kept as long as needed to review them and keep the app safe.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Edit your name and photo at any time in <b>Settings \u2192 Edit name &amp; photo</b>.</li>\n<li><b>Delete your account</b> in <b>Settings \u2192 Delete account</b>. This permanently deletes your profile, photo and stats from our database and removes your sign-in.</li>\n<li>If you are in the EU/EEA or UK, you have rights under the GDPR to access, correct, delete, or receive a copy of your data, and to object to processing. Contact us at the email above. You can also complain to your local data protection authority.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Age</h2>\n<p>Fingo is intended for people aged <b>18 and over</b>. Some decks contain adult themes, and the app asks you to confirm you are 18+ before you start. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>\n<h2>Community rules</h2>\n<p>By using Fingo you agree not to post or say anything that is hateful, harassing, threatening, sexually explicit, involves minors, or shares someone's private information. <b>There is no tolerance for objectionable content or abusive users.</b> You can report any player, card or answer, and block people. We review reports within 24 hours and remove content and ban users who break these rules.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>If we change this policy we will update the date above and, for significant changes, tell you in the app.</p></div><div class=\"foot\"><a style=\"color:#a99bc6\" href=\"/fingo/privacy/\">Privacy &amp; rules</a> \u00b7 <a style=\"color:#a99bc6\" href=\"/fingo/delete-account/\">Delete account</a></div></div></body></html>", "delete-account/index.html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Fingo \u2014 Delete your account</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#12051f;color:#12051f;font:16px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter',Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}\n.wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}.card{background:#F6EFFF;border-radius:32px;padding:28px 24px}\nh1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:900}h2{font-size:22px;margin:26px 0 6px;font-weight:800}\na{color:#0d0d0f}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#fff;padding:8px 4px 16px;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none}\n.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#0d0d0f;color:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin:6px 6px 0 0}\n.green{background:#FF6B5F;color:#12051f}.foot{color:#a99bc6;font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:18px}li{margin:4px 0}</style></head><body><div class=\"wrap\"><a class=\"top\" href=\"/fingo/\"><img class=\"logo\" src=\"/fingo/fingo-mark.png\" alt=\"\">Fingo</a><div class=\"card\"><h1>Delete your account</h1>\n<p>You can delete your Fingo account and all its data at any time, right inside the app:</p>\n<ol><li>Open <b>Fingo</b> and tap the <b>\u2699\ufe0f settings</b> icon on the home screen.</li><li>Scroll down and tap <b>Delete account</b>.</li><li>Confirm. If you signed in with Apple or Google you'll be asked to confirm it's you.</li></ol>\n<h2>What gets deleted</h2><ul><li>Your profile: name and photo</li><li>Your stats (games, times exposed, crowns) and your block list</li><li>Your sign-in (Apple, Google or guest ID)</li></ul>\n<p>Party data (answers, anonymous cards, reactions) is deleted automatically within 24 hours of each party. Voice chat is never recorded. Reports you filed about others may be kept for up to 90 days for safety reviews.</p>\n<h2>Can't open the app?</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:developer@destinyglobals.com\">developer@destinyglobals.com</a> with the subject <b>\u201cDelete my Fingo account\u201d</b> and your display name. We'll delete your data within 30 days and confirm by email.</p></div><div class=\"foot\"><a style=\"color:#a99bc6\" href=\"/fingo/privacy/\">Privacy &amp; rules</a> \u00b7 <a style=\"color:#a99bc6\" href=\"/fingo/delete-account/\">Delete account</a></div></div></body></html>", "mark": ""}